    body = [=[
\**{c=red:Note:}** Unlike the other **A Mightier Martello** quests, this quest is part of a series of quest. There are two prior quests that must be completed first before you are able to complete this one.
=2 Walkthrough
__Only one **Refuel and Replenish** or **A Mightier Martello** quest can be completed per Vana'dielian day, regardless of Abyssea area.__
* Speak to the {n:Machine Outfitter (Konschtat)} near the entrance of zone, and choose "Assist with upgrades" to accept the quest.
** You will obtain a {@k} {k:Fuel reservoir}.
** You cannot zone at any point during the quest, or you lose the key item and you must restart.
* Find a {p:Martello} in the zone. They are usually around the various Confluxes, or you can see a list on the {p:Martello} page.
** It is possible to upgrade it even if it is already at 100%.
* Click on "Prepare to upgrade martello" in the menu once you interact with one, then confirm.
* The log will tell you a direction to stand in order to upgrade the device, but the menu will tell you a different direction. Best results are achieve by following the direction in the menu.
** Although it is not in the log, the {@k} {k:Fuel reservoir} will be replaced with the {@k} {k:Cracked fuel reservoir}.
* Return to the {n:Machine Outfitter (Konschtat)} to complete the quest.

